  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Time $T_1$ from $A$ to $B=\\frac{12}{4}=3 \\mathrm{hrs}$\n$T_2$ from $B$ to $C=\\frac{5}{5}=1 \\mathrm{hrs}$.\nTotal time $=4 \\mathrm{hrs}$.\nAverage speed $=\\frac{17}{4} \\mathrm{~km} / \\mathrm{hr}$.\nResultant average velocity $=\\frac{13}{4} \\mathrm{~km} / \\mathrm{hr}$.\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/COmYFhY9bp82bnVhvDIhCt7Y9KuV2tCdCGZplbAORQI.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
